                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has a big design flaw which can actually be seen in the videos. The notes are coming from above when they should be coming from the front like in every other drum / rhytm game. This creates a big problem. \nLook at the video when he's hitting a hi-hat and a drum, he's focusing on the left part of the drum set and has no way of knowing what's happening on the right side so he doesn't see the notes because they spawn directly over the drums.\nIf the notes were comming in front of you from a distance (like in Guitar Hero etc.) there would be no problem.\nSo unless this is fixed I can't recommend this game to anybody.",
